---
import SiteFooter from '../components/SiteFooter.astro'
import SiteHeader from '../components/SiteHeader.astro'
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro'
import { SITE } from '../lib/site'

const updated = 'June 14, 2026'
const contactEmail = 'contact@kinora.dev'
---

<Layout
  title="Terms - kinora"
  description="Terms of service for kinora."
  pathname="/terms"
>
  <SiteHeader />
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 py-16 sm:px-8 sm:py-24">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl">Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="mt-3 font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-muted-foreground">
      Last updated: {updated}
    </p>

    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col gap-8">
      <section class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        <p class="leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
          These terms govern your use of the hosted {SITE.name} service. By accessing or using it, you
          agree to them. The service is operated by <span class="text-foreground">Joris Gallot</span>.
          Self-hosting {SITE.name} is governed by its open-source licenses (FSL-1.1-MIT for the server
          and dashboard, MIT for the client libraries), not these terms.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight">The service</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
          {SITE.name} is a dashboard for Playwright test reports across projects and over time, with an
          embedded trace viewer. It offers a Free plan and paid plans. Features and limits per plan are
          described on the pricing page and may change as the product evolves.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Subscriptions and billing</h2>
        <ul class="flex flex-col gap-2 text-muted-foreground">
          <li>Plan prices are shown on the pricing page and at checkout.</li>
          <li>Paid subscriptions auto-renew each billing period until you cancel.</li>
          <li>Cancellation takes effect at the end of the current billing period; you keep access until then.</li>
          <li>Billing is handled by our payment provider, Polar, acting as merchant of record.</li>
          <li>Payments are non-refundable, except where a refund is required by mandatory applicable law.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Your content</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
          You keep ownership of the test data and artifacts you upload. You grant {SITE.name} the rights
          needed to store and display them to you and your workspace. You are responsible for what you
          upload, including not sending secrets or data you are not allowed to share. We handle your data
          as described in our
          <a href="/privacy" class="text-signal underline-offset-4 hover:underline">Privacy Policy</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Acceptable use</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
          Do not misuse the service, attempt to disrupt or gain unauthorized access to it, exceed plan
          limits through circumvention, or use {SITE.name} in violation of applicable law.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Third-party services</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
          {SITE.name} relies on third-party infrastructure and providers, including Polar (billing),
          Hetzner (hosting and storage), Resend (email), Sentry (error monitoring), and Google or GitHub
          if you choose social sign-in. Availability and behavior may depend on those services.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Disclaimer and liability</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
          {SITE.name} is provided on an "as is" and "as available" basis, without warranties of any kind.
          {SITE.name} may change, break, or lose data. To the maximum extent permitted by
          law, we disclaim all warranties and are not liable for any indirect, incidental, special, or
          consequential damages, or for loss of data, revenue, or profits. Keep your own copies of
          anything you cannot afford to lose.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Termination</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
          You can stop using the service and delete your account at any time. We may suspend or terminate
          access for serious or repeated violations of these terms or applicable law.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Governing law</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
          These terms are governed by French law. Any dispute falls under the jurisdiction of the courts
          of Lyon, France, unless mandatory law provides otherwise.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Changes</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
          We may update these terms as the service evolves. Material changes will be reflected by the date
          above; continued use after a change means you accept the updated terms.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Contact</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
          Questions about these terms:
          <a href={`mailto:${contactEmail}`} class="text-signal underline-offset-4 hover:underline">{contactEmail}</a>.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
  <SiteFooter />
</Layout>
